<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n57138" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κηπ-αῖος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῆπος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>from a garden,
				cultivated</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. σίκυες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					926b7
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.146
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.627
			</span></i> (v.l.), etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. παράδεισοι</span>
			<i>garden-like</i> parks, <i><span class="en">
				Clearch.
				6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κηπαία</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύρα</span>), ἡ, <i>gardendoor,
				back-door</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hermipp.
				47.9
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				1.76
			</span></i>; prov., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῖς κ. θύραις</span> 'by
			the back-stairs', <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				7.25
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				2.98
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>a herb, Sedum Cepaea</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.151
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
